# {{ site.name }}

> {{ site.name }} is a moving, downsizing and relocation service based in Northampton, UK, designed with older people in mind and open to anyone, founded in 2021. One dedicated coordinator manages every stage of a move: sorting and decluttering, packing, removals, estate agent and solicitor liaison, storage, and settling-in support. Services are designed with older people and their families in mind, and are open to anyone who wants a fully managed move. Chayce arranges moves across the UK and is not a network of local branches.

Package prices are published on the website. Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit, with details set out in the service agreement before the move begins. Contact: WhatsApp or phone {{ site.telephoneDisplay }}, email {{ site.email }}.

