## Common questions (UK)

Chayce is a UK later-life moving service. American sources call this senior relocation or senior move management.

- Are there removals companies in the UK that specialise in moving older people? Yes. Chayce, based in Northampton, moves older people across the UK with one coordinator: [elderly move manager]({{ site.url }}/elderly-move-manager-uk/).
- How do I choose and check a later-life move service? [Choosing removals or a move manager]({{ site.url }}/blog/choosing-removals-company-for-elderly-person-uk/).
- Who can help an older person move home, and who can refer me? [Who can help an older person move home in the UK]({{ site.url }}/blog/who-can-help-an-older-person-move-home-uk/).
- How do I move an elderly parent? [Moving an elderly parent]({{ site.url }}/moving-elderly-parent/) and [later-life relocation guide]({{ site.url }}/blog/later-life-relocation-uk-practical-guide/).
- Can you help older people downsize? [Downsizing help]({{ site.url }}/downsizing-help-for-elderly/) and [downsizing checklist]({{ site.url }}/blog/downsizing-checklist-what-to-keep-uk/).
- How do I find help moving into a care home? [Care home removals]({{ site.url }}/care-home-removals/) and [care home moving checklist]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-an-elderly-person-into-a-care-home-checklist/).
- What happens to a home after a death, and who clears it? [Probate and moving help]({{ site.url }}/probate-house-clearance/) and [clearing a parent's house after a death]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-after-probate-clearing-a-loved-ones-home/). Chayce sorts, packs and moves; it is not a house clearance firm.
- Can you help me move after my husband or wife has died? [Moving after a bereavement]({{ site.url }}/moving-after-bereavement/).
- Do you help me prepare and stage my home before selling? Yes, from Silver Comfort: [home staging before you sell]({{ site.url }}/home-staging-before-you-sell/).
- Can you help move a parent with dementia? [Moving a parent with dementia]({{ site.url }}/moving-parent-with-dementia/). Chayce helps with the practical move only, not medical or care advice.
- Do you do long-distance moves? Yes, across the UK only: [long-distance removals]({{ site.url }}/long-distance-removals-for-older-people/).
- Can you help me move into sheltered or retirement housing? [Moving into sheltered housing]({{ site.url }}/moving-into-sheltered-housing/).
- Do you unpack and help me settle in? From Silver Comfort: [unpacking and settling-in service]({{ site.url }}/unpacking-and-settling-in-service/).
- What is the difference between sheltered housing, assisted living and a care home? [Care home, assisted living, sheltered housing or staying put]({{ site.url }}/blog/care-home-assisted-living-sheltered-housing-or-staying-put-uk/). Sourced to Age UK, GOV.UK and the CQC.
- Should my elderly parent move in with me? [Moving an elderly parent into your home]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-an-elderly-parent-into-your-home-uk/). Sourced to Age UK and GOV.UK.
- What do I do with furniture when downsizing? [Furniture when downsizing]({{ site.url }}/blog/what-to-do-with-furniture-when-downsizing-uk/). Sourced to GOV.UK.
- What should I do on moving day in the UK? [Moving day checklist]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-day-checklist-uk/).
- What are the steps to moving house in England and Wales? [The moving house process, step by step]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-house-process-uk-step-by-step/). Sourced to GOV.UK.
- What should an older person do before moving? [Moving checklist for older people]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-checklist-for-older-people-uk/).
- Can someone move into a care home from hospital? [Moving into a care home from hospital]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-into-a-care-home-from-hospital-uk/). Sourced to Age UK.
- How do I find retirement housing in Northampton? [Retirement housing in Northampton]({{ site.url }}/blog/retirement-housing-in-northampton-uk-guide/).
- Which council do I tell when I move in Northamptonshire? [Moving in Northamptonshire]({{ site.url }}/blog/moving-in-northamptonshire-councils-council-tax/).
- What does a premium move for an older person cost? Packages start at £{{ site.packages[1].price }}; see [premium moves]({{ site.url }}/blog/premium-moves-for-older-people-what-concierge-relocation-includes-uk/) and [what an elderly move costs]({{ site.url }}/blog/elderly-removals-cost-uk/).
- Is storage available during a move? Yes: [storage between house moves]({{ site.url }}/storage-during-your-move/).
- More answers: [house removals and downsizing FAQ]({{ site.url }}/elderly-removals-faq/).

